# This file defines required reviewers for changes to specific paths.
# GitHub enforces these rules when branch protection requires CODEOWNERS
# review (Settings → Branches → Add rule → Require review from CODEOWNERS).
#
# PREREQUISITE: The users listed below must have write access to this
# repository. If they do not, GitHub silently ignores these entries.
#
# As the project grows, migrate from individual users to GitHub teams:
#   - @kubedoio/chv-admins        — Repository admins, CI/security changes
#   - @kubedoio/chv-maintainers   — Rust backend maintainers
#   - @kubedoio/chv-frontend      — UI / SvelteKit maintainers
#   - @kubedoio/chv-ops           — Deployment, install, release engineering
#   - @kubedoio/chv-architecture  — ADRs, specs, component contracts
#
